Add methods positionBlocked/safeSavedPosition. Place near teleport or save. Let's add before teleport or after distanceTo. Use world existence guard.

```js
positionBlocked(x,z,radius=.6) {
  if (!this.world) return false;
  return this.world.colliders.some(c => x>c.minX-radius && x<c.maxX+radius && z>c.minZ-radius && z<c.maxZ+radius);
}
safeSavedPosition(pos) {
  if (!pos || !Number.isFinite(pos.x) || !Number.isFinite(pos.z)) return null;
  if (this.positionBlocked(pos.x,pos.z, .8)) return null;
  return {x:pos.x, z:pos.z};
}
```

Also need bounds check maybe. Clamp? world.bounds. Add check x within bounds and z. Use safe. Let's insert after teleport.

Also could fix `loadProgress` to not set y to saved position? It only sets x,z; y remains 0; world ground height may be >0 elsewhere. Actually player.position.y initialized 0 and loadProgress sets x,z but not y; ground could be elevated at some places (maybe hills). The player update sets y to ground only after physics. Fine.

Let's add helpers.

